###############################################
# WebSocket 连接和消息测试
###############################################

### 1. 获取 WebSocket 连接信息
GET http://localhost:9501/api/ws/connect?token=test_token_123
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 获取连接信息(带客户端ID)
GET http://localhost:9501/api/ws/connect?token=test_token_123&client_id=test_client_001
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 获取连接信息(带额外参数)
GET http://localhost:9501/api/ws/connect?token=test_token_123&client_id=test_client_002&room=room_001&user_type=admin
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 无效 Token 测试
GET http://localhost:9501/api/ws/connect
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 无效 Token 值测试
GET http://localhost:9501/api/ws/connect?token=invalid_token
Content-Type: application/json 